#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:1
msgid "人物缺陷词条"
msgstr "Character Defect Entries"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:3
msgid "作者"
msgstr "Author"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:4
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;瑾"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Jin"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:7
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;采用CDE（人物缺陷词条 Character Defect Entry），即人物出场常驻 Debuff "
"词条系统。通过玩家完成特定游戏任务后消除特定词条，在完成所有人物相关剧情或完成所有相关任务目标后，人物的所有常驻 Debuff 会被全部清除。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;游戏⻆色个体的成⻓性存在上限值，并且所有⻆色到达上限值后具有相同（或存在差异？）的数值。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Adopt CDE (Character Defect Entry), a persistent Debuff entry system active when characters enter the field. "
"Players can remove specific entries by completing certain game tasks. After completing all character-related storylines or all related task objectives, all persistent Debuffs on the character will be cleared."
"   &emsp;&emsp;Each game character's individual growth has an upper limit, and all characters have the same (or different?) stats upon reaching the maximum."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:10
msgid "备选性格缺陷词条名称"
msgstr "Candidate Personality Defect Entry Names"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:12
msgid "鼠目寸光，心胸狭隘，孤陋寡闻，懒惰，任性，刻薄，贪吃，贪睡，贪玩，阴险，狡诈，无趣，幼稚，小气，冲动，自以为是，眼高手低，好高骛远，虚荣心强，爱吹牛，爱显摆，势利，胆小怕事，短视，急功近利，拖沓，口是心非，自私自利，贪功夺利，拈轻怕重，缺乏理性，感情用事"
msgstr "Short-sighted, Narrow-minded, Ignorant, Lazy, Capricious, Harsh, Gluttonous, Sleepy, Playful, Sinister, Cunning, Boring, Childish, Stingy, Impulsive, Conceited, Ambitious but Incompetent, Reaching for the Sky, Vain, Boastful, Show-off, Snobbish, Timid, Myopic, Eager for Quick Success, Dilatory, Hypocritical, Selfish, Greedy for Credit, Avoiding Hard Work, Irrational, Emotional"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:13
msgid "专横，忸怩，乏味，散漫，无同情心，不宽恕，无热忱，唠叨，逆反，怨恨，保守，健忘，直率，挑剔，胆小，好插嘴，急躁，无安全感，优柔寡断，难预测，不善表达，不受欢迎，不合群，即兴，固执，难于取悦，犹豫不决，放任，自负，悲观，贫乏，易怒，好争吵，不合群，无目标，幼稚，鲁莽，消极，冷漠，虚荣，工作狂，不喜交际，担忧，喋喋不休，不圆滑老练，过分敏感，胆怯，生活紊乱，跋扈，抑郁，怀疑，反复，排斥异己，内向，无异议，杂乱无章，喜操纵，情绪化，言语不清，好表现，顽固，猜疑，缓慢，大嗓⻔，统治欲，孤僻，懒惰，不专注，易怒，多疑，拖延，报复型，烦躁，勉强，轻率，善变，狡猾，好批评，妥协"
msgstr "Bossy, Shy, Dull, Undisciplined, Unsympathetic, Unforgiving, Unenthusiastic, Nagging, Rebellious, Resentful, Conservative, Forgetful, Blunt, Picky, Timid, Interrupting, Impatient, Insecure, Indecisive, Unpredictable, Inarticulate, Unpopular, Antisocial, Impromptu, Stubborn, Hard to Please, Hesitant, Permissive, Conceited, Pessimistic, Impoverished, Irritable, Argumentative, Antisocial, Aimless, Childish, Reckless, Negative, Apathetic, Vain, Workaholic, Asocial, Worried, Chatterbox, Tactless, Oversensitive, Cowardly, Disorganized, Domineering, Depressed, Suspicious, Inconsistent, Exclusive, Introverted, Compliant, Messy, Manipulative, Emotional, Incoherent, Show-off, Obstinant, Suspicious, Slow, Loud, Dominating, Solitary, Lazy, Unfocused, Short-tempered, Paranoid, Procrastinating, Vengeful, Anxious, Reluctant, Rash, Fickle, Crafty, Critical, Compromising"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:15
msgid "人物缺陷词条示例"
msgstr "Character Defect Entry Examples"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:17
msgid "粗心：释放攻击技能时会发生15%的命中失误"
msgstr "Careless: 15% miss chance when using attack skills"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:18
msgid "不专注：远程攻击时会发生30%的命中失误"
msgstr "Unfocused: 30% miss chance on ranged attacks"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:19
msgid "懒惰：移动与攻击速度减缓25%"
msgstr "Lazy: Movement and attack speed reduced by 25%"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:20
msgid "胆小：当生命值低于50%时攻击力下降50%"
msgstr "Timid: Attack power reduced by 50% when HP drops below 50%"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:21
msgid "瘦弱：生命上限缩减为50%"
msgstr "Frail: Maximum HP reduced to 50%"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:22
msgid "任性：面对敌人时5%的几率随机使用一个可用技能"
msgstr "Capricious: 5% chance to randomly use an available skill when facing enemies"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:23
msgid "冲动：进入战场前60秒各项属性提升5%，过60秒后各项属性降低10%"
msgstr "Impulsive: All attributes increased by 5% for the first 60 seconds of battle; after 60 seconds, all attributes decreased by 10%"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:24
msgid "自以为是：受到敌人攻击后，攻击力下降40%"
msgstr "Conceited: Attack power decreased by 40% after being attacked by an enemy"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:25
msgid "不合群：周围存在友方队员时，移动和攻击速度减缓10%"
msgstr "Antisocial: Movement and attack speed reduced by 10% when friendly units are nearby"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/cde.md:26
msgid "眼高手低：增加10%的攻击力，降低15%的攻击速度急功近利：增加10%的攻击速度，降低15%的攻击力"
msgstr "Ambitious but Incompetent: Increases attack power by 10%, reduces attack speed by 15%. Eager for Quick Success: Increases attack speed by 10%, reduces attack power by 15%"
